    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nThis fine 2 bedroom, first floor apartment represents a fantastic opportunity to purchase a holiday home in Kilkee at excellent value. It is ideally located within walking distance of the beach and all local amenities. Accommodation comprises 61 sq.m. and includes and open plan living and dining area, a kitchen, store room, bathroom and two bedrooms. Externally, there is a balcony/patio area with seating. The property is being sold in turn key condition (with the exception of personal effects) making it ideal as an immediate holiday home or investment property for long or short term rentals."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving/Dining Room - \nOpen plan layout complete with laminate flooring, a tv point and an electric fireplace. Sliding doors lead to a patio/seating area. Front aspect.\n\nKitchen - \nThe kitchen is complete with fully fitted wall and base units, tiled flooring and a tiled splash back.\n\nUtility/Store Room - \nPlumbed. Ideal utility section. Hot press is housed here.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nLocated to the back of the property, this double bedroom is complete with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nAlso located to the back of the property, this double bedroom is complete with carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - \nPartially tiled and complete with bath, wc and whb\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>First floor 2 bedroom apartment</li><li>For sale in turn key condition (bar personal effects)</li><li>Ideally located within walking distance of the beach and all amenities </li><li>Established residential devlopment</li><li>Management fee 950 approx per annum</li><li>Ample parking facilities</li><li>Patio with seating area</ul>"
      },
